OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FManchester United captain Bruno
OL,7,FFernandes has been crowned
OL,8,FProfessional Footballers' Association
OL,9,FPlayer of the Year as Manchester
OL,10,FCity's Khadija Shaw won the women's
OL,11,Faward for the second time.
OL,13,FPlaymaker Fernandes broke the all-time
OL,14,Frecord for Premier League assists
OL,15,Fduring an outstanding 2025-26
OL,16,Fcampaign, setting up 21 goals as he
OL,17,Fsurpassed Thierry Henry and Kevin De
OL,18,FBruyne.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
