PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1788606030
OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old also scored nine times
OL,7,Fas United overcome a shaky first half
OL,8,Fof the campaign to finish third in the
OL,9,FPremier League under Michael Carrick
OL,10,Fand earn a Champions League return.
OL,12,FFernandes was pleased to have been
OL,13,Fvoted the winner by his fellow
OL,14,Fprofessionals.
OL,16,FHe said: "It is obviously a very proud
OL,17,Fmoment. They are the ones you go on
OL,18,Fthe pitch against and it's probably
OL,19,Fnot easy to vote for someone you play
OL,20,Fagainst, so it is a very good moment."
