OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FThe Portugal international is the Red
OL,7,FDevils' first winner since Wayne
OL,8,FRooney took home the trophy in 2009-10
OL,9,Fand adds to his Football Writers'
OL,10,FAssociation Footballer of the Year
OL,11,Faward from May.
OL,13,FManchester City sharpshooter Shaw, who
OL,14,Fwas also recognised by the FWA,
OL,15,Fscooped the PFA Women's Player of the
OL,16,FYear award for the second time.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
