OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FThe 29-year-old claimed the trophy in
OL,7,F2023-24 and won it again having scored
OL,8,F21 goals on the way to a third
OL,9,Fstraight Golden Boot and her maiden
OL,10,FWomen's Super League title.
OL,12,FArsenal's Olivia Smith picked up the
OL,13,Fwomen's PFA Young Player of the Year
OL,14,Ftitle for the second campaign running,
OL,15,Fhaving won the 2025 crown for her
OL,16,Fexploits at Liverpool and continued
OL,17,Fher form in the capital.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
