OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FManchester City's Nico O'Reilly was
OL,7,Fnamed men's PFA Young Player of the
OL,8,FYear following an outstanding campaign
OL,9,Fthat ended with the versatile talent
OL,10,Fhelping England to win World Cup
OL,11,Fbronze.
OL,13,FThe 21-year-old was part of the PFA
OL,14,FPremier League Team of the Year along
OL,15,Fwith City team-mates Erling Haaland,
OL,16,FRayan Cherki and Antoine Semenyo.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
