OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FO'Reilly said: "I had a great season.
OL,7,FI'm very proud of the season I had. I
OL,8,Fwon two trophies with my club and
OL,9,Fmanaged to play at the World Cup with
OL,10,Fmy country. I'm over the moon how it
OL,11,Fturned out."
OL,13,FChampions Arsenal had five
OL,14,Frepresentatives in David Raya,
OL,15,FGabriel, William Saliba, Jurrien
OL,16,FTimber and Declan Rice, with Player of
OL,17,Fthe Year Fernandes of United and
OL,18,FBrentford's Igor Thiago completing the
OL,19,Fteam.
