OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FThe PFA WSL Team of the Year featured
OL,7,Fthree players from triumphant City,
OL,8,Fwith Shaw joined by team-mates Kerstin
OL,9,FCasparij and Yui Hasegawa.
OL,11,FMariona Caldentey, last year's PFA
OL,12,FWomen's Player of the Year, was joined
OL,13,Fin the XI by fellow Arsenal players
OL,14,FEmily Fox and Alessia Russo.
OL,16,FTottenham defender Toko Koga and
OL,17,FManchester United's Jess Park were
OL,18,Falso included in a team, as were the
OL,19,FChelsea trio of Hannah Hampton, Ellie
OL,20,FCarpenter and Lauren James.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
