OL,3,CShaw and Fernandes recognised by PFA
OL,4,Cafter excellent campaigns
OL,6,FSwindon striker Aaron Drinan's
OL,7,Fperformances saw him collect the
OL,8,FLeague Two award, while Lily
OL,9,FCrosthwaite of Birmingham took the
OL,10,FWSL2 player accolade.
OL,12,FSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,13,Freceived the PFA merit awards in
OL,14,Frecognition of their contribution to
OL,15,Ffootball.
OL,17,FDalglish enjoyed a success-laden
OL,18,Fcareer as player with Celtic and
OL,19,FLiverpool, and is Scotland's most
OL,20,Fcapped player having represented his
OL,21,Fcountry on 102 occasions.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
